## Current stop — R6 source-review checkpoint

The local implementation items checked above have source and static-review receipts only. R4 native containment and trusted host authorization/capacity remain blocked prerequisites; checked code-writing tasks do not make R4 operationally complete. Project-scale build inputs beyond the bounded pilot are not implemented. R7 remains entirely unexecuted. Final source hashes/delta and exact review dispositions are in CHANGE-RECEIPT.json and SOURCE-REVIEW.md.

No tests, builds, typechecks, runtime imports/probes, trial restores, services, installations, cloud provider operations, provisioning, spending, secret changes, commits, pushes, merges, deployments or cleanup were performed. Baseline/source/disk observations, metadata inventories, source/document edits and local receipt preparation are the actual evidence.
